# Public-by-design build-time values, safe to commit: the Supabase URL and
# publishable key ship in the browser bundle regardless, and every grant they
# carry is bounded by row-level security in the database. Secrets (service
# role, provider API keys) never belong in this file — they live in Worker
# runtime secrets only.
